title: "eia-api"
abstract: >-
  A small Python wrapper for the U.S. Energy Information Administration (EIA)
  API v2 — electricity, petroleum, natural gas, coal and renewables — that walks
  the route tree, handles facets and pagination, and returns tidy pandas
  DataFrames.
